flowchart TB
    accTitle: Diagnose a MISP problem before changing configuration
    accDescr: First record the symptom and version, inspect health and logs, and identify the affected layer. Then choose a scoped change, test on an isolated copy and verify the result.
    subgraph Understand["Understand the failure"]
        direction LR
        A["Record symptom and version<br/>Branch · runtime · request"] --> B["Inspect health and logs<br/>Match the request or job"] --> C["Identify the layer<br/>Access · service · schema · data"]
    end
    subgraph Validate["Validate a change"]
        direction LR
        D["Choose a scoped change<br/>Expected effect · recovery"] --> E["Test on an isolated copy<br/>Permissions · state · failures"] --> F["Verify the result<br/>Record the change and reason"]
    end
    Understand --> Validate
